# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST. Nothing is tracked unless it is named below.
#
# The README says this repo "only tracks intentionally selected files". A
# denylist cannot deliver that: it tracks whatever nobody thought to exclude, so
# the first mistake is a leak. This file inverts the default instead.
#
#   *      ignore every file, everywhere
#   !*/    but still descend into directories, so a re-include below can be
#          reached (git will not look inside an ignored directory)
#   !path  re-include exactly one file
#
# Consequences worth knowing before editing:
#
#   - Adding a file to the repo is TWO steps. `git add newfile` will refuse
#     ("ignored by one of your .gitignore files") until you add a `!` line for
#     it here. That refusal is the feature: every tracked file is a decision.
#   - `git status` stays quiet about junk - build output, downloaded archives,
#     an app that dumped a cache into a config directory - instead of inviting
#     you to `git add -A` it by accident.
#   - Paths starting with `/` are anchored to the repo root, so `!/zshrc`
#     cannot accidentally re-include some other directory's `zshrc`.
#   - Bulk directory re-includes are avoided on purpose. `!/config/**` would
#     hand back the whole subtree, which is denylist behaviour again.
#
# The defensive patterns at the bottom are redundant while the allowlist holds -
# they exist for when it does not. If a future edit re-includes a directory in
# bulk, those patterns are the second line of defence that still keeps
# credentials, keys, histories and databases out.
#
# Run `bin/dotfiles-doctor --only scan` before pushing; CI additionally fails if
# any tracked file matches an ignore rule (an allowlist hole) and runs gitleaks
# over the full history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*
!*/


# ---- repo documentation and bootstrap inputs ----
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/setup.md
!/manifest.tsv
!/Brewfile
!/Brewfile.optional
!/install.sh
!/lib/brew-dependencies.sh
!/lib/orcw.py

# ---- CI ----
!/.github/workflows/ci.yml

# ---- tests ----
!/tests/install-brew-skips.sh
!/tests/install-agent-extras.sh
!/tests/orcw.sh

# ---- scripts (installed to ~/bin, must stay mode 755) ----
!/bin/dotfiles-doctor
!/bin/rebuild-alttab
!/bin/orcw

# ---- shell ----
!/zshenv
!/zshrc

# ---- vim ----
!/vimrc
!/vim/plugins.txt
!/vim/templates/skeleton.c
!/vim/templates/skeleton.cpp
!/vim/templates/skeleton.rkt
!/vim/templates/skeleton.rmd
!/vim/templates/skeleton.tex

# ---- git ----
!/gitconfig
!/config/git/ignore

# ---- agents ----
!/agents/AGENTS.md
!/agents/SKILLS.md
!/agents/claude/settings.json
!/agents/codex/config.toml
